{"3918410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CICADA", "steam_appid": 3918410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a generational action-simulation game set in the rural summer of Japan, where you live out the fleeting life of a cicada.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.mp4?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this brief existence,<br>how will you live — and what will you leave behind?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful foes and claim victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fall short, yet pass your will to the next generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply wander the fields, embracing the summer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single cicada’s story — fleeting, yet burning bright.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.mp4?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Mating System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even cicadas want to grow stronger.<br>In this game, you don’t just level up — you pass on your power through <strong>mating</strong>.<br>Soar through a vast open field, find your ideal partner, and mate to create a stronger next generation!<br>Control your offspring, inherit powerful traits, and challenge the enemies your previous self couldn’t beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Vitality System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is limited. Life is fleeting.<br>Your cicada’s <strong>vitality</strong> constantly decreases from the moment the game begins.<br>When it hits zero, your life comes to an end…<br>That’s why every second counts — who will you meet, how will you live, and what legacy will you leave?<br>To survive, you must pass on your life. A bittersweet yet powerful experience awaits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the peaceful countryside of Japan, in the middle of summer.<br>Paddy fields, tall grass, streams, rustling trees—<br>Fly freely as a cicada and explore a living, breathing summer world.<br>From above, the scenery looks like a miniature diorama full of detail and charm.<br>Discover, collect, and feel the world through the eyes of a cicada in this unique open-world adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations are free to stream this game without prior permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in the video description or elsewhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that we are not responsible for any damages arising from the streaming of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust various settings such as graphics quality, mouse sensitivity, and more from the Options menu.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a generational action-simulation game set in the rural summer of Japan, where you live out the fleeting life of a cicada.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.mp4?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this brief existence,<br>how will you live — and what will you leave behind?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful foes and claim victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fall short, yet pass your will to the next generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply wander the fields, embracing the summer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single cicada’s story — fleeting, yet burning bright.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so