es arising from the streaming of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust various settings such as graphics quality, mouse sensitivity, and more from the Options menu.</p>", "short_description": "This game is a roguelite simulation action title, where you play as a single cicada striving to survive the summer in the Japanese countryside.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/ea7cd9d40f8eb4d1bb3a5f105760e71ac68bef3b/header.jpg?t=1759201222", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/0e9d466faa7312e0e46aed17b2ad9883e8519c23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759201222", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/0e9d466faa7312e0e46aed17b2ad9883e8519c23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759201222", "website": "https://x.com/bi_karu", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows  11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11800H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["daimaGAME"], "publishers": ["daimaGAM